36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found the subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand yen. Last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand yen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,So the station block is already fighting over a broken latch. And nobody wants to be the one saying no to a late bag. We’re doomed.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Midori, forty percent is a start, but the real cost is our time. I need to know exactly how many hours this setup will drain from our weeks.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen annually in waste. The complaint log reveals one household filed eleven of fourteen entries. This imbalance is unacceptable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, that’s a lot of money! But I found the bin house smells worse in summer, and supervised mornings take fifty minutes each. That’s twenty times a year!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, fifty minutes is manageable if we rotate. @Asuka, that ledger entry is worrying. We need to fix the open bags to stop that thirty-four thousand yen drain.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, eleven complaints from one house? That’s not a bin problem, that’s a personality disorder. We need a rule that doesn’t require us to be friends.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, personality disorders are expensive. I’m calculating the setup hours now.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, it is not a personality disorder; it is a structural failure. The ledger proves the current location creates disproportionate burden. We must address this.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I don’t think it’s a personality disorder! I think the bin house is just a stinky trap. We need a spot that doesn’t smell bad in August!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I hear your frustration, but let’s stay focused. @Asuka, the ledger confirms the waste is real. We need a solution that stops the leaks and shares the cost fairly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, structure is fine, but people are the problem. If we can’t share a space without suing, we’re stuck.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, structure is just a fancy word for who gets stuck holding the bag. I’m tallying the hours, not the insults.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the data confirms the burden is physical, not emotional. The ledger proves the current location fails. We must redistribute the load.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree! The bin house is a stinky trap. We need a spot that doesn’t smell bad in August, or I’m moving my shoes!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I agree. The ledger shows real waste. We need a spot that stops the leaks and shares the cost fairly among all five households.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, structure doesn’t fix silence. If we can’t knock on doors after this, the best spot is a failure. Let’s pick something that keeps us talking.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
